{"title":"어떤 마술의 금서목록 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=HePfm/dJMcajw8nEw/OtGjqkvnKGfKC6ApTsRABK&filename=th3","synopsis":"초능력이 일반 과학처럼 인지된 안티 오컬트의 학원도시에서 초능력은 레벨0에 불과하지만 모든 초능력을 무효화시키는 오른팔, 이매진 브레이커를 가진 불운의 사나이 카미조 앞에 한 수녀복 차림의 소녀가 하늘에서 떨어진다.\n그녀의 이름은 인덱스. 10만 3천권의 마도서를 머릿속에 담고 있는 완전기억 능력자지만, 1년에 한 번씩 마도서를 제외한 모든 생활의 기억을 리셋해야 하는 불행한 소녀 인덱스와 카미조의 액션 판타지가 펼쳐진다.\n(원작 : Kazuma Kamachi)\nⓒChuya Kogino/SQUARE ENIX CO., LTD.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":272,"change":{"type":"down","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":164,"change":{"type":"up","amount":108}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":251,"change":{"type":"down","amount":87}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":283,"change":{"type":"down","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":220,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":277,"change":{"type":"down","amount":57}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":143,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":208,"change":{"type":"down","amount":65}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":269,"change":{"type":"down","amount":61}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":141,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":207,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":262,"change":{"type":"down","amount":55}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":150,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":205,"change":{"type":"down","amount":55}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":246,"change":{"type":"down","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":204,"change":{"type":"up","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":145,"change":{"type":"up","amount":59}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":198,"change":{"type":"down","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":238,"change":{"type":"down","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-10-04","rank":126,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-05","rank":206,"change":{"type":"down","amount":80}},{"date":"2026-10-06","rank":25